---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About" description="A little about this blog and who writes it.">
  <h1 class="font-serif text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-50">About</h1>

  <div class="prose prose-stone font-serif text-lg mt-6 dark:prose-invert">
    <p>
      Hi, I'm teamtae. This is where I write about the things I spend most of my time thinking
      about: sports, education, investing, books, and technology.
    </p>
    <p>
      I don't post on a fixed schedule. New entries show up whenever I have something worth
      saying, so browse by category from the nav above, or subscribe via <a href="/rss.xml">RSS</a> to
      get new posts as they're published.
    </p>
  </div>
</Layout>
